{
 "scenes": [
  {
   "id": "c11_competition",
   "title": "The Grand Power Competition",
   "bg": "grand_arena",
   "lines": [
    {
     "cmd": "chapter",
     "t": "CHAPTER 11\nThe Grand Power Competition"
    },
    {
     "cmd": "music",
     "id": "battle"
    },
    {
     "s": "narrator",
     "t": "The Grand Arena. Fifty thousand people. Cameras from every network on Nexa."
    },
    {
     "cmd": "show",
     "c": "professor",
     "e": "happy",
     "p": "center"
    },
    {
     "s": "professor",
     "e": "happy",
     "t": "And our final registered competitor — a late entry… Peter Parker!"
    },
    {
     "s": "narrator",
     "t": "Silence. Then laughter. Then, slowly, whispering."
    },
    {
     "cmd": "show",
     "c": "bruce",
     "e": "angry",
     "p": "right"
    },
    {
     "s": "bruce",
     "e": "angry",
     "t": "You're joking. The runaway?"
    },
    {
     "cmd": "show",
     "c": "peter",
     "e": "normal",
     "p": "left"
    },
    {
     "s": "peter",
     "e": "normal",
     "t": "Hello, Bruce. Long time."
    },
    {
     "cmd": "hide_all"
    },
    {
     "cmd": "competition",
     "id": "grand_competition",
     "win": "c_win",
     "lose": "c_lose",
     "place": 1
    },
    {
     "cmd": "label",
     "name": "c_win"
    },
    {
     "cmd": "flag",
     "set": [
      "grand_champion"
     ],
     "unset": []
    },
    {
     "s": "narrator",
     "t": "The scoreboard doesn't just put Peter in first place. It runs out of digits."
    },
    {
     "cmd": "goto",
     "label": "c_after"
    },
    {
     "cmd": "label",
     "name": "c_lose"
    },
    {
     "s": "narrator",
     "t": "The results are close — but the crowd saw what happened. Peter held back. Everyone could tell."
    },
    {
     "cmd": "label",
     "name": "c_after"
    },
    {
     "cmd": "show",
     "c": "bruce",
     "e": "angry",
     "p": "right"
    },
    {
     "s": "bruce",
     "e": "angry",
     "t": "Scores mean nothing. Fight me. Here. Now."
    },
    {
     "cmd": "show",
     "c": "peter",
     "e": "serious",
     "p": "left"
    },
    {
     "s": "peter",
     "e": "serious",
     "t": "If that's what you want."
    },
    {
     "cmd": "music",
     "id": "boss"
    },
    {
     "cmd": "combat",
     "enemy": "bruce_rematch",
     "win": "b_win",
     "lose": "b_lose"
    },
    {
     "cmd": "label",
     "name": "b_win"
    },
    {
     "s": "narrator",
     "t": "It's over in seconds. Bruce teleports — Peter is already there. Fire and ice meet a white light and simply… go out."
    },
    {
     "cmd": "show",
     "c": "bruce",
     "e": "surprised",
     "p": "right"
    },
    {
     "s": "bruce",
     "e": "surprised",
     "t": "What… are you?"
    },
    {
     "s": "peter",
     "e": "normal",
     "t": "Still Peter. Still the kid who kept getting up."
    },
    {
     "cmd": "rep",
     "add": {
      "public": 50,
      "hero": 30,
      "combat": 40
     }
    },
    {
     "cmd": "goto",
     "label": "ending"
    },
    {
     "cmd": "label",
     "name": "b_lose"
    },
    {
     "s": "narrator",
     "t": "Bruce lands a lucky blow — but Peter never stopped smiling. The crowd saw it: he was holding back the entire time."
    },
    {
     "cmd": "label",
     "name": "ending"
    },
    {
     "cmd": "news",
     "key": "grand_competition_result"
    },
    {
     "cmd": "hide_all"
    },
    {
     "cmd": "show",
     "c": "john",
     "e": "happy",
     "p": "right"
    },
    {
     "s": "john",
     "e": "happy",
     "t": "TOLD YOU ALL! THAT'S MY BEST FRIEND!"
    },
    {
     "cmd": "show",
     "c": "mother",
     "e": "happy",
     "p": "center"
    },
    {
     "s": "narrator",
     "t": "In the stands, Elena Parker stands very still, tears on her face, smiling."
    },
    {
     "cmd": "hide_all"
    },
    {
     "cmd": "bg",
     "id": "zero_throne",
     "tr": "black"
    },
    {
     "cmd": "music",
     "id": "boss"
    },
    {
     "cmd": "show",
     "c": "zero",
     "e": "serious",
     "p": "center"
    },
    {
     "s": "narrator",
     "t": "Far above Nexa, in a throne room that hangs among the stars, someone is watching the broadcast."
    },
    {
     "s": "zero",
     "e": "happy",
     "t": "That light. That instinct. So… Richard's son finally came home."
    },
    {
     "s": "zero",
     "e": "serious",
     "t": "How wonderful. I was getting bored."
    },
    {
     "cmd": "hide_all"
    },
    {
     "cmd": "chapter",
     "t": "TO BE CONTINUED\nThe Zero Arc — coming in the next update"
    }
   ],
